<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="wrap inner-page journal-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/blog'>Project journal</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">case study <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1>MBK Downloader and Text to Handwriting: focused tools for focused tasks</h1><p class="article-deck">A multi-platform video downloader that turns a supported video link into a simple, focused download workflow.</p></section>
<div class="academy-reading-layout"><aside class="academy-toc"><p class="academy-kicker">IN THIS PROJECT</p><nav aria-label="On this page"><a href="#main-content">Project overview</a></nav><div class="academy-author"><img src="/assets/images/mbk-personal-favicon-96.png" width="38" height="38" alt=""><div>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Founder, MBK Global</small></div></div><p class="academy-read-note">2 min read · Practical learning notes<br>Learn. Apply. Make it your own.</p><a class='academy-text-link' href='/resources'>More learning resources ↗</a></aside><div class="academy-reading-body"><p class="eyebrow">MBK JOURNAL / ARTICLE</p><p class="article-link"><a href='/blog'>← All articles</a></p><article class="journal-article" id="tools"><div class="article-index">05 <span>WEB TOOLS</span></div><div class="article-body"><p class="article-kicker">SMALL UTILITIES, REAL LESSONS</p><p>MBK Video Downloader is built to work with supported platforms such as YouTube, Instagram, Facebook and TikTok, alongside other sources supported by its current downloader service. The goal is to let visitors paste a video link and use the available download formats or quality options without navigating a complicated interface.</p><p>Platform support, available formats and download quality can vary with the source platform and the connected service. Users should only download content they own or are authorized to save, and follow each platform's terms and applicable copyright rules.</p><p>The related Text to Handwriting project is a separate creative utility that transforms typed text into a handwriting-inspired presentation. Together, these tools explore simple inputs, clear options, API integration and useful interface states.</p><p><a class="article-link" href="https://mbkdownloader.vercel.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">MBK Downloader ↗</a> <span class="article-separator">/</span> <a class="article-link" href="https://handster.netlify.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Text to Handwriting ↗</a></p><div class="article-meta">MBK UTILITIES · BUILD LOG</div></div></article><p class="article-link"><a href='/blog'>Back to the MBK journal ↗</a></p><section aria-label="Related MBK portfolio pages" class="mbk-related-links"><h2>Explore related MBK pages</h2><p>Continue exploring Bakhtawar Khan (MBK), MBK Global projects and practical digital technology resources.</p><ul><li><a href="/">Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global — Web Development, AI &amp; Digital Technology</a></li><li><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global</a></li><li><a href='/projects'>Projects by Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/services'>Web Development, AI, APIs &amp; SEO Services | Bakhtawar Khan</a></li><li><a href='/resources'>Web Development, API, SEO &amp; Accessibility Resources | MBK</a></li><li><a href='/blog'>Articles &amp; Guides by Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/official-links'>Official Links &amp; Projects</a></li><li><a href='/contact'>Contact Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/article-mbk-tv'>MBK TV Project | Digital Media Experience by MBK</a></li><li><a href='/article-mbk-markets'>MBK Markets Project | Market Data Interface by MBK</a></li><li><a href='/article-noor-e-quran'>Noor-e-Quran Project | Digital Learning Experience by MBK</a></li></ul></section></div></div><div data-portrait-track data-caption="The person behind the work"></div></main><script src="assets/js/script.js"></script><footer class="academy-footer"><div><a class="academy-brand personal-brand" href="/"><span>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global</small></span></a><p>Thoughtful technology. Useful knowledge. Work in progress.</p></div><nav aria-label="Footer"><a href='/resources'>Resources</a><a href='/official-links'>Official links</a><a href='/gallery'>Gallery</a><a href='/resume'>Resume</a><a href='/faq'>FAQ</a><a href='/privacy-policy'>Privacy</a></nav><div class="academy-colophon"><span>© 2026 Bakhtawar Khan · MBK Global</span><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer><script defer src="/assets/js/portfolio.js"></script><script defer src="/assets/js/visual-track.js"></script></body></html>